	<content contentuid="h13216a20g2eb6g4ea6ga99bg1a754d22e93d" version="1">&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="TutorialRedWarning"/&gt; [Temporary]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A test readout that will be removed in a later update.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;How close the Pyre of this fight is to its next step. At 100% the step rises by one, and whatever went past 100% is kept for the next one.&lt;br&gt;The count only fills once the Pyre has reached its &lt;b&gt;Pyre Equilibrium&lt;/b&gt;. It fills faster the more health you take off the bosses and ULTRA mini-bosses in a round, and a fight that drags on speeds it up on its own.&lt;br&gt;At the highest step the count stops just short of 100%.</content>
